    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="El. 36">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Af">Af</ref> El. 36</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Gif mon næbbe buton anfeald hrægl hine mid to wreonne ⁊ to werianne, ⁊ he hit to wedde selle, ær sunnan setlgonge sie hit agifen. Gif ðu swa ne dest, þonne cleopað he to me, ⁊ ic hine gehiere, forðon ðe ic eom swiðe mildheort.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">If someone has but one article with which to cover and clothe himself, and he gives it to you in pledge, let it be returned to him before the setting of the sun. If you do not do so, then he will cry out to me, and I will hear him, because I am greatly merciful.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Gif man næbbe butan anfeald hrægl hine mid to wreonne oððe to werianne, and he hit to wedde sylle, ær sunnan setlgange sy hit agifen. Gif þu swa ne dest, þonne clypiað hy to me, and ic hy gehyre, forðam þe ic eam swyþe mildheort.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
